abstract: >-
  Public distribution of the Structural Reading Protocol, a natural-language
  execution architecture for controlling what to examine, when to invoke
  analysis or research, and when to stop. Distribution 1.0.4 preserves
  Protocol v8.3.18 and Trigger Index v0.1 unchanged and applies only
  downstream license-detection and release-metadata packaging changes.
